    "name": "The Scientist Battles",
    "steam_appid": 3824280,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Science used to be your purpose, but now it is your prison.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a distorted version of your lab, shaped by the quiet, unseen struggles of scientific research, you must find your way out. Battle with lab-inspired tools and science-themed companions in light 2D combat! As in science, the way forward isn\u2019t always a choice.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short narrative journey with an emotional, introspective tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D combat using lab equipment and science-inspired companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooted in the lived experience of someone who's been through the ups and downs of research</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824280/extras/5ea358dbdc0204a0af8587e38dc0f3f5.avif?t=1755644627\" data-has-big width=800 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Alright. Deep breaths. Let\u2019s find the way out of here. I\u2019ve got loads of experiments waiting for me back in the real world.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Researcher's log</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I started this game while unemployed, after moving to a new country, and decided to finish it after settling into a new job in a lab. It\u2019s inspired by the quieter, often unspoken stories behind scientific research. I hope the game resonates with you, even just a little bit, whether you're in the lab, playing for the story, or just finding your way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Shaun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Science used to be your purpose, but now it is your prison.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a distorted version of your lab, shaped by the quiet, unseen struggles of scientific research, you must find your way out. Battle with lab-inspired tools and science-themed companions in light 2D combat! As in science, the way forward isn\u2019t always a choice.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short narrative journey with an emotional, introspective tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D combat using lab equipment and science-inspired companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooted in the lived experience of someone who's been through the ups and downs of research</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824280/extras/5ea358dbdc0204a0af8587e38dc0f3f5.avif?t=1755644627\" data-has-big width=800 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Alright. Deep breaths. Let\u2019s find the way out of here. I\u2019ve got loads of experiments waiting for me back in the real world.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Researcher's log</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I started this game while unemployed, after moving to a new country, and decided to finish it after settling into a new job in a lab. It\u2019s inspired by the quieter, often unspoken stories behind scientific research. I hope the game resonates with you, even just a little bit, whether you're in the lab, playing for the story, or just finding your way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Shaun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Science used to be your purpose, now it is your prison. Step into the lab as a scientist fighting through doubt, repressed memories, and mounting pressure. Battle with lab equipment, team up with science-inspired companions, and face down your fears in light 2D combat!",
